Subject: [PATCH 12/49] Two-graph DFlash rounds (NINFER_GRAPH_SPLIT=1): capture
 ends at the drafter/verify seam

Research flag, off by default. launch() submits the drafter graph before the verify graph. Same-GPU A/B
on c96-ft1 (research6): no measurable change (json/code/prose/sustained within 0.6%), so it stays off.
